# Generated by `paraglide-js compile`, which runs in `prepare`. Everything in
# project.inlang except settings.json is a build artifact — the directory's own
# .gitignore says exactly that. CI regenerates them unformatted and prettier
# flagged them; locally they happened to already be formatted.
#
# The comment is on its own line deliberately: .prettierignore uses gitignore
# syntax, where `#` only opens a comment as the first character of a line, so a
# trailing `# note` after a pattern becomes part of the pattern and matches
# nothing.
project.inlang/
